WEBVTT

01:51.807 --> 01:54.114
[explosions]

02:20.531 --> 02:22.881
[dramatic music]

03:52.406 --> 03:53.407
[yells]

04:13.775 --> 04:19.781
[yelling]

04:26.440 --> 04:28.616
[action music]

04:29.834 --> 04:31.183
[gunshot]

04:43.848 --> 04:48.200
[gunshots]

05:54.702 --> 05:58.096
[bittersweet music]

08:17.409 --> 08:20.412
