10:30.804 --> 10:35.547
[crying and screaming]

14:25.952 --> 14:28.780
[sweet melodic music]

15:13.564 --> 15:20.310
[fire crackling]

15:38.328 --> 15:39.503
[knocks on door]

16:13.146 --> 16:16.149
[soft instrumental music]

17:42.800 --> 17:45.020
[music continues]

19:10.671 --> 19:14.544
[soft violin music]

21:30.289 --> 21:33.640
[soft instrumental music]

22:52.980 --> 22:54.242
[music continues]
